deepseek-multimodal-RAG|rag|Retrieve PDF pages visually and answer with DeepSeek Janus-Pro.|ColPali page embeddings are stored in Qdrant; selected page images become multimodal generation context.|Compare page-level retrieval against extracted text on tables and multi-column documents.|Keep rendering, embedding and generation in separate resource pools; version visual embeddings and reject incompatible indexes.
