fastest-rag-stack|retrieval|Combine quantized Qdrant retrieval with SambaNova-hosted generation.|Embedding, binary-quantized storage, retrieval and synthesis are distinct classes in rag_code.py.|Vary candidate count and quantization settings while recording recall, warm/cold latency and final answer support.|Cache embeddings by content hash, maintain index-version metadata and measure end-to-end latency rather than vendor inference alone.
