imagegen-janus-pro|media|Study local Janus-Pro multimodal understanding and image generation.|Model/processor loading, token generation, decoding and image unpacking are separate functions inside the original UI script.|Fix a seed and vary classifier-free guidance and temperature; compare consistency, diversity and peak GPU memory.|Extract a model worker with a queue, pin remote model code and batch compatible requests under a GPU memory limit.
