sdv-mcp|mcp|Expose local synthetic-data training, generation and statistical evaluation through MCP.|Server tools wrap SDV generation, quality evaluation and visualization of tabular data.|Hold back real rows, compare statistical fidelity and test whether rare rows are memorized in generated output.|Treat source data as sensitive, isolate training jobs and evaluate privacy risk separately from distribution similarity.
siamese-network|training|Learn digit similarity through paired examples and contrastive loss.|Twin branches share an encoder; ContrastiveLoss moves matching pairs closer and nonmatching pairs beyond a margin.|Use a fixed pair split and sweep distance thresholds; report ROC/PR behavior instead of a single accuracy value.|Export the shared encoder and version the decision threshold with preprocessing; prevent train/test image leakage through pair construction.
