sonnet4-vs-qwen3-coder|evaluation|Evaluate Claude and Qwen3-Coder against repository-grounded tasks.|Parallel response generation and DeepEval scoring are supplemented by a batch-comparison notebook.|Repeat each task with fixed and varied seeds and report correctness variance and cost per passing solution.|Separate candidate generation from grading jobs and version both model mappings and evaluator configuration.
stagehand x mcp-use|agents|Connect a local agent to browser-automation tools through MCP.|Stagehand tools are exposed through a server and consumed by an mcp-use agent wrapper; presentation tracking is excluded.|Try a page with hostile instructions and verify that tool calls remain inside the approved task and destination set.|Run browsers in disposable isolated contexts, restrict network destinations and require authorization for external state changes.
stock-portfolio-analysis-agent|agents|Stream a portfolio-analysis workflow from a CrewAI backend.|StockAnalysisFlow coordinates data gathering, simulation, allocation and insights and emits AG-UI-compatible events.|Freeze prices and random seeds, then compare risk metrics and allocations against deterministic reference calculations.|Keep portfolio computations in reviewed deterministic code, timestamp data and isolate each authenticated user's financial inputs.
train-yolo26-object-detection|training|Fine-tune an object detector on a custom Roboflow dataset and track experiments.|The notebook retrieves a dataset, trains a YOLO checkpoint, logs to Comet and inspects predictions.|Split by scene/source rather than near-duplicate frames and compare per-class AP, missed detections and inference latency.|Version dataset labels and augmentations, register exported weights and validate target-device inference before deployment.
trustworthy-rag|rag|Attach trustworthiness signals to document-grounded model output.|LlamaParse and retrieval build context while Cleanlab trustworthiness callbacks expose scores and reasoning.|Calibrate score thresholds on labeled supported and unsupported answers; plot coverage against error rate.|Use an abstention/review policy calibrated to the actual domain; a vendor confidence score is not a correctness guarantee.
ultimate-ai-assitant-using-mcp|mcp|Explore one agent connecting to several MCP servers.|mcp-use client configuration and agent creation connect local/hosted models to a union of tools.|Give two servers similarly named tools and test selection, least privilege and what happens when one disconnects.|Use a tool registry with explicit scopes, authenticate each server and avoid passing the full process environment to child servers.
video-rag-gemini|media|Upload video to Gemini and ask grounded questions about its contents.|VideoProcessor and the headless demo upload a file, wait for processing and send multimodal requests.|Ask about a brief event near the end of a long video and score temporal accuracy and unsupported details.|Use resumable upload jobs, bounded processing polling and explicit remote-file deletion after the configured retention period.
web-browsing-agent|agents|Plan and execute browser research with CrewAI and Stagehand.|BrowserAutomationFlow creates an AutomationPlan, calls a browser tool and synthesizes results.|Change the page structure and inject misleading instructions; measure task completion and unauthorized-action prevention.|Isolate browser workers, enforce destination/action policies in code and store compact evidence for every completed action.
Website-to-API-with-FireCrawl|structured|Convert web content into schema-constrained extraction results.|The notebook builds dynamic Pydantic extraction schemas and calls Firecrawl to produce structured data.|Remove required fields and alter page layout and test schema validity independently from semantic extraction accuracy.|Expose only approved extraction schemas and destinations, cap crawl size and validate results before returning them to downstream consumers.
Youtube-trend-analysis|agents|Analyze channel or niche trends from collected video transcripts.|Bright Data collection feeds CrewAI agents configured by YAML to summarize and analyze video evidence.|Use channels with unequal posting rates and repeated videos and check whether conclusions reflect normalized evidence.|Keep collection and analysis separate, version transcript snapshots and track rate limits, duplicates and freshness explicitly.
zep-memory-assistant|memory|Add persistent Zep memory to an AutoGen conversational agent.|ZepConversableAgent retrieves memory and stores session interactions through utility functions.|Introduce a corrected preference in a later session and test whether stale memory still dominates the reply.|Bind memory to authenticated users, redact sensitive turns and implement deletion across sessions and graph-derived context.
zep-observations|memory|Study how graph conversation data becomes behavioral observations.|A seed script writes example conversations and a check script inspects generated observations.|Change one conversation and compare which observations persist; verify that inferred patterns are labeled as inferences.|Use consented synthetic fixtures for experiments and control retention, user namespaces and the presentation of inferred traits.
